<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>God in Christ, embodied,</l><l>As God’s lampstand, He</l><l>Has become the Spirit,</l><l>The reality.</l><l>Spirit as the lampstand</l><l>Has been multiplied;</l><l>Many local churches,</l><l>Now are realized!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Caring for the churches</l><l>Is the Son of Man:</l><l>Voice of many waters,</l><l>Stars in His right hand;</l><l>Eyes aflame; His face is</l><l>Shining as the sun;</l><l>Churches—fear no trial,</l><l>He’s the living One!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>What can quench the lampstands?</l><l>Who can them defy?</l><l>More the opposition—</l><l>More they multiply!</l><l>Deeper darkness ’round them,</l><l>Brighter do they shine.</l><l>They are constituted</l><l>With the life divine.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
